  "2026-10-23..25": "M3 Kaggle path: notebook v1 (build pattern from AGI-2),
      smoke on T4/cpu; AGI-2 v9+submit window runs SAME days (separate
      kernels; CPU dev here does not contend with AGI-2 GPU jobs)",
  "2026-10-26":   "ENTRY both tracks (accept rules on Kaggle UI — S5);
      first AGI-3 submit if smoke green",
  "2026-10-27..11-01": "M4 iterate both tracks; AGI-3: generalization
      pass (avoid public-overfit; hidden set is OOD); optional RSI
